# Vercel CLI uploads (deploy/README.md, fallback path). Keep the 3 GB cache and local envs out.
# Do NOT list .git here: this file is also applied to Git-integration builds, and without .git the
# ignoreCommand in frontend/vercel.json (git diff) cannot run. The CLI never uploads .git anyway.
.venv
data/cache
backend/.cache
experiments
**/node_modules
**/.next
frontend/public/cubes
**/__pycache__
*.fits
